# Per-round working state written by the engine when the harness repo is
# itself the workspace. Round artifacts and the CURRENT pointer are
# machine-local execution state, like runtime/ and worktrees/ above — a
# round would otherwise dirty the tree on every run. Root-anchored so the
# tracked workspace_template/2_Working_State/ copy is unaffected.
.harness/rounds/
/2_Working_State/

